Output todo.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 800
Set Height 600
Set Theme "Dracula"

Type "../../ramune run todo.tsx"
Enter
Sleep 800ms

Down
Sleep 300ms
Down
Sleep 300ms
Type "x"
Sleep 500ms

Type "i"
Sleep 400ms
Type "drink ramune"
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 600ms

Down
Down
Down
Sleep 300ms
Type "s"
Sleep 2s

Type "q"
Sleep 400ms
